{{!-- Spanish shell. Two vocabularies meet here, so both are named explicitly:
     `documentLang` is the BCP-47 tag that goes in <html lang>, and `locale` is the
     theme's content-locale key — the same es/br/en value the layouts and post cards
     already take. They differ for Portuguese: the tag is `pt`, the key is `br`
     (matching the /br/ collection in routes.yaml). --}}
{{> "shell" documentLang="es" locale="es"}}
